+// Opt-in virtual device (the main-menu tile). All three run on the DSI callback thread with the connection, the only place
+// a send is valid, and under the handler rules above. onMessage returns true when the message was for the device: it is
+// then not routed to the other consumers. Without a hook the client stays observe-only.
